<h2 id="aciub-mapping-source" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">7. Project-specific mapping source</h2>

- Keep this rule free of hard-coded tracker paths beyond the **implref** plan path the user named.
- Resolve extra trackers from: `war_stories/WAR_STORIES_PROJECT_SPECIFIC.md`.
- If mapping is missing and a tracker update is required, ask once for the tracker list, then continue.

